    "detailed_description": "<h1>Special Offer</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1857580/extras/ff5149d1d8e09021af31fa3907c251ed.avif?t=1662667634\" /></div><br><br>The main goal of this game is to get achievements. You don't even need to play it \u2013 the game itself will give them to you. If you're polite to her\u2026<br><br>This is a short sketch exploring such a phenomenon in the world of computer games as &quot;trophy hunting&quot;. Complete the tasks that the game gives you, get all-new achievements for them, test yourself \u2013 will you dare to collect them all?<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1857580/extras/69565ce0e0ae3c4269e6b3ee9d7a448b.poster.avif?t=1662667634\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1857580/extras/69565ce0e0ae3c4269e6b3ee9d7a448b.webm?t=1662667634\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1857580/extras/69565ce0e0ae3c4269e6b3ee9d7a448b.mp4?t=1662667634\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Is this a visual novel?<br>Is this a dating simulator?<br>Is this an experiment?<br>This:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Short duration<br></li><li>Psychedelic pixel visual style<br></li><li>Many achievements<br></li><li>A lot of achievements!</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1857580/extras/06619eedb0498f0cf3741a00728a2c7f.poster.avif?t=1662667634\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1857580/extras/06619eedb0498f0cf3741a00728a2c7f.webm?t=1662667634\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1857580/extras/ff5149d1d8e09021af31fa3907c251ed.avif?t=1662667634\" /></div><br><br>The main goal of this game is to get achievements. You don't even need to play it \u2013 the game itself will give them to you. If you're polite to her\u2026<br><br>This is a short sketch exploring such a phenomenon in the world of computer games as &quot;trophy hunting&quot;. Complete the tasks that the game gives you, get all-new achievements for them, test yourself \u2013 will you dare to collect them all?<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1857580/extras/69565ce0e0ae3c4269e6b3ee9d7a448b.poster.avif?t=1662667634\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1857580/extras/69565ce0e0ae3c4269e6b3ee9d7a448b.webm?t=1662667634\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1857580/extras/69565ce0e0ae3c4269e6b3ee9d7a448b.mp4?t=1662667634\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Is this a visual novel?<br>Is this a dating simulator?<br>Is this an experiment?<br>This:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Short duration<br></li><li>Psychedelic pixel visual style<br></li><li>Many achievements<br></li><li>A lot of achievements!</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1857580/extras/06619eedb0498f0cf3741a00728a2c7f.poster.avif?t=1662667634\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1857580/extras/06619eedb0498f0cf3741a00728a2c7f.webm?t=1662667634\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div>",
